      "scene_key": "autumn_term_field", "scenario_id": "three_shells", "reward_honey": 2,
      "target_minutes": 11, "time_limit_seconds": 780, "energy_drain": 0.8, "hazard": "echo", "map_variant": 3,
      "intro": "三只独立种壳要朝向不同花路。声音同时有可见波纹，停下来就更容易分清。",
      "dialogue": "画眉：左边一只，右边一只，中间那只很爱插话。",
      "world_trace": "三只种壳成为秋图永久路线标记。",
      "objectives": [
        {"type": "observe", "label": "分清三条声路", "goal": 3},
        {"type": "shell", "label": "转正独立种壳", "goal": 3}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "autumn_hanlu", "order": 16, "season_id": "autumn", "kind": "standard",
      "scene_key": "autumn_term_field", "scenario_id": "clear_sound", "reward_honey": 4,
      "target_minutes": 12, "time_limit_seconds": 840, "energy_drain": 0.86, "hazard": "fog", "map_variant": 4,
      "intro": "飞行声会盖住远处提示。停翅一会儿，看着可视波纹找到高坡，再收好远花。",
